from sys-hall-single.replay
# sys-frontier-records (scripts_battle_frontier_records.s, frontier/records/main.c): after the Hall singles challenge
# (Garchomp's record 1), the Hall's record machine: "Which record?", SINGLE, no streak on, so "Which Pokémon's
# record?", the letter groups (GHI), the record list (ShowBattleHallRecordMonSelectionMenu: the species with a singles
# record, then EXIT), Garchomp: the records app (FACILITY_HALL) with its record, B back to the list, which keeps its
# place; EXIT, the letters' EXIT, CANCEL.
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_BATTLE_HALL 7 9 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
until menu 600
# SINGLE
+5 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until menu 600
# GHI (the third letter group)
+5 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press a
+1 release a
until menu 600
+5 screenshot records-list
# Garchomp (the list's first)
+2 press a
+1 release a
until app frontier-records 600
+30 screenshot records-hall
+0 press b
+1 release b
until app none 300
advance text 600
until menu 600
# EXIT (the list's second)
+5 press down
+1 release down
+2 press a
+1 release a
until menu 600
# The letters' EXIT (the tenth; the list kept GHI)
+5 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press a
+1 release a
until menu 600
# CANCEL (the challenge types' fourth)
+5 press up
+1 release up
+2 press a
+1 release a
until idle 600
+0 assert map platinum:MAP_HEADER_BATTLE_HALL
